Definition.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Tamil Nadu Land Reforms (Fixation of Ceiling on Land) Act, 1961 (Tamil Nadu Act
58 of 1961
);
(b)
"Bond" means the bond prescribed in Form A;
(c)
"Form" means a form appended to this rules;
(d)
"section" means a section of the Act.
